OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADisruption at Port of Dover as
OL,4,Amasked men hold protest
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police, which made no arrests,
OL,7,Fsaid officers had been "engaging with
OL,8,Fprotesters" before moving them from the
OL,9,Fport to Dover Priory railway station at
OL,10,Fabout 11:30 BST. It added that "all
OL,11,Finvolved had dispersed by 12:00".
